                        "2026-06-15 13:00:08,398  INFO      Dataset loaded and filtered: 96988 events remain after applying energy, angle, and particle count filters.\n",
                        "2026-06-15 13:00:08,444  WARNING   DEBUG_MODE active â€” using 72741 events out of full dataset. Results are NOT representative.\n"
                    ]
