                        "2026-06-15 13:00:27,047  INFO      Begin training â€” best model checkpoints will be saved to: d:\\OneDrive - Universidad Técnica Federico Santa María\\CONDOR_OD\\Tesis\\CONDOR_MCDropout_XAI\\pipeline_artifacts\\condor_best_model.keras\n"
