                        "Epoch 1/125\n",
                        "1205/1205 [==============================] - ETA: 0s - loss: 0.8771 - f1_score: 0.8046 - accuracy: 0.7990\n",
                        "Epoch 1: val_loss improved from inf to 0.46255, saving model to d:\\OneDrive - Universidad Técnica Federico Santa María\\CONDOR_OD\\Tesis\\CONDOR_MCDropout_XAI\\pipeline_artifacts\\condor_best_model.keras\n",
                        "1205/1205 [==============================] - 251s 200ms/step - loss: 0.8771 - f1_score: 0.8046 - accuracy: 0.7990 - val_loss: 0.4625 - val_f1_score: 0.8094 - val_accuracy: 0.8287 - lr: 5.0000e-04\n",
