                        "2026-06-15 07:22:50,144  DEBUG     findfont: score(FontEntry(fname='C:\\\\Windows\\\\Fonts\\\\REFSAN.TTF', name='MS Reference Sans Serif', style='normal', variant='normal', weight=400, stretch='normal', size='scalable')) = 10.335\n",
