                        "2026-06-15 07:22:50,144  DEBUG     findfont: score(FontEntry(fname='C:\\\\Windows\\\\Fonts\\\\Candarali.ttf', name='Candara', style='italic', variant='normal', weight=400, stretch='normal', size='scalable')) = 11.335\n",
