                        "2026-06-15 07:22:50,787  INFO      Guardado: d:\\OneDrive - Universidad TÃ©cnica Federico Santa MarÃ­a\\CONDOR_OD\\Tesis\\CONDOR_MCDropout_XAI\\pipeline_artifacts\\diagnostics\\calibration_reliability_diagram.png\n"
