                        "2026-06-15 07:23:10,232  DEBUG     findfont: score(FontEntry(fname='C:\\\\Windows\\\\Fonts\\\\SegUIVar.ttf', name='Segoe UI Variable', style='normal', variant='normal', weight=400, stretch='normal', size='scalable')) = 10.05\n",
