                        "2026-06-15 07:23:10,235  DEBUG     findfont: score(FontEntry(fname='C:\\\\Windows\\\\Fonts\\\\GILBI___.TTF', name='Gill Sans MT', style='italic', variant='normal', weight=700, stretch='normal', size='scalable')) = 11.335\n",
                        "2026-06-15 07:23:10,235  DEBUG     findfont: Matching DejaVu Sans Display:style=normal:variant=normal:weight=normal:stretch=normal:size=24.0 to DejaVu Sans Display ('c:\\\\Users\\\\alanz\\\\miniconda3\\\\envs\\\\condor-cnn-trans\\\\lib\\\\site-packages\\\\matplotlib\\\\mpl-data\\\\fonts\\\\ttf\\\\DejaVuSansDisplay.ttf') with score of 0.050000.\n",
                        "2026-06-15 07:23:11,334  INFO      Guardado: d:\\OneDrive - Universidad TÃ©cnica Federico Santa MarÃ­a\\CONDOR_OD\\Tesis\\CONDOR_MCDropout_XAI\\pipeline_artifacts\\diagnostics\\bayesian_coverage_efficiency.png\n"
