                        "2026-06-15 08:05:34,691  DEBUG     findfont: score(FontEntry(fname='c:\\\\Users\\\\alanz\\\\miniconda3\\\\envs\\\\condor-cnn-trans\\\\lib\\\\site-packages\\\\matplotlib\\\\mpl-data\\\\fonts\\\\ttf\\\\STIXSizFourSymReg.ttf', name='STIXSizeFourSym', style='normal', variant='normal', weight=400, stretch='normal', size='scalable')) = 10.05\n",
