                        "2026-06-15 08:05:52,428  INFO      âœ“ Guardado: d:\\OneDrive - Universidad TÃ©cnica Federico Santa MarÃ­a\\CONDOR_OD\\Tesis\\CONDOR_MCDropout_XAI\\pipeline_artifacts\\diagnostics\\attn_global_particle.png\n"
