                    "text": [
                        "Modo kernel: ðŸ”¥ CALIENTE (variables en RAM)\n",
                        "\n",
                        "Leyendo variables desde RAM...\n",
                        "\n",
                        "âœ…  paper_ready_data.json (15.3 KB) â€” modo ðŸ”¥ hot\n",
                        "  AUC-ROC:        0.9903150395190915\n",
                        "  ECE (cal):      0.017839744787425338\n",
